Condition observations, diagnosis and prediction (@mech-condition-evidence: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @mechanical-engineering, #source "../sources/Manufacturing-Diagnostics-and-Prognostics-Vogl.lingua#r_11J2W3H9ZM5J2Q1VYVMF1D41HY", #source "../sources/Bearing-Maintenance-Handbook-SKF.lingua#r_2KXP88XVRZAFSYK92QAM6QYYRV", #mechanical-engineering "Maintenance-intervals-access-and-functional-evidence.lingua#r_0GJDWMZFSFC6Y6DYH6G07BP5F1", #materials-engineering "Maintenance-intervals-access-and-functional-evidence.lingua#r_0GJDWMZFSFC6Y6DYH6G07BP5F1", #industrial-gases-and-vacuum "../../../utilities/industrial-gases-vacuum-and-high-purity-supplies/operation/Condition-trends-need-a-physical-comparison.lingua#r_2J8QT5CJPBNBCMFR5XDXMQXFPE") { r_4PJF2YX9VDRZMDF31M6C290BEP
**Read:** [Diagnostic and prognostic capabilities — Vogl, Weiss and Helu](../sources/Manufacturing-Diagnostics-and-Prognostics-Vogl.lingua#r_11J2W3H9ZM5J2Q1VYVMF1D41HY), complete paper; [Bearing maintenance handbook — SKF, 2011](../sources/Bearing-Maintenance-Handbook-SKF.lingua#r_2KXP88XVRZAFSYK92QAM6QYYRV), inspection, troubleshooting and damage chapters.

A measurement indicates condition through a model. Increased vibration may follow load, imbalance, alignment, looseness or a changed sensor mounting. Detection asks whether behavior changed; diagnosis asks why; prognosis predicts future behavior conditional on loading and intervention. These claims require different evidence.

Retain operating state, time, sensor location, calibration and processing with each observation. Compare like conditions before treating a trend as deterioration. A predictive model evaluated on randomly mixed segments of the same machine history may benefit from information unavailable in future service; separate machines or future periods when that matches the intended claim.

**Work:** Compare two explanations for one condition change and propose a discriminating measurement. Establish a baseline under several loads. Evaluate missed detections and false alarms, not just average fit. Express remaining-life predictions as conditional uncertain claims and show how a maintenance action would change their interpretation.

**Return:** [Mechanical engineering and machine design](../Mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design.lingua#r_0017YZ63HZBZ4P4WD8DECVWE4R).
